n mask bugs (you expected a value but the map was never initialized).\n",[36,1353,1355],{"class":38,"line":1354},21,[36,1356,1357],{"class":1326},"- **Concurrent map access is fatal**: not a recoverable panic — the program crashes. The runtime detects concurrent map writes and aborts. Use `sync.RWMutex`\u002F`sync.Map`.\n",[36,1359,1361,1364,1366,1369,1371],{"class":38,"line":1360},22,[36,1362,1363],{"class":1326},"- **Map iteration order is randomized**: don",[36,1365,1323],{"class":115},[36,1367,1368],{"class":46},"t rely on iteration order — it changes between runs (the runtime randomizes it). Sort keys ",[36,1370,463],{"class":42},[36,1372,1373],{"class":46}," stable output.\n",[36,1375,1377,1379,1381,1384,1386,1389,1391,1394,1396,1399,1401,1404,1406],{"class":38,"line":1376},23,[36,1378,822],{"class":42},[36,1380,1055],{"class":42},[36,1382,1383],{"class":46},"Slices, maps, functions can",[36,1385,1323],{"class":115},[36,1387,1388],{"class":1326},"t be keys**: they",[36,1390,1323],{"class":115},[36,1392,1393],{"class":46},"re not ",[36,1395,895],{"class":147},[36,1397,1398],{"class":46}," (no equality). Use a ",[36,1400,56],{"class":42},[36,1402,1403],{"class":46}," or ",[36,1405,957],{"class":42},[36,1407,1408],{"class":46}," representation as the key.\n",[36,1410,1412,1414,1416,1419,1421,1423,1426],{"class":38,"line":1411},24,[36,1413,822],{"class":42},[36,1415,1055],{"class":42},[36,1417,1418],{"class":46},"Deleting during iteration",[36,1420,739],{"class":42},[36,1422,119],{"class":46},[36,1424,1425],{"class":115},"`for k := range m { delete(m, k) }`",[36,1427,1428],{"class":46}," is safe (Go allows it) — it deletes every key. But adding keys during iteration is unspecified (may or may not be iterated).\n",[36,1430,1432,1434,1436,1439,1441,1444,1446,1448,1451,1453,1456,1458,1460,1463,1466,1468],{"class":38,"line":1431},25,[36,1433,822],{"class":42},[36,1435,1055],{"class":42},[36,1437,1438],{"class":115},"`len(nil map) == 0`",[36,1440,739],{"class":42},[36,